  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラホールから　しゅつげんした。\nふくすうの　せいめいが　つみあがり\n１ぴきを　けいせいしている　ようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "울트라홀에서 출현했다.\n여러 개의 생명이 쌓여\n1마리를 형성하고 있는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從究極之洞中出現。\n似乎是由多數的生命\n堆積起來形成的個體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est sorti d’une Ultra-Brèche. Il est composé\nde plusieurs petites entités qui s’assemblent\npour n’en former qu’une seule.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Kreatur kam durch eine Ultrapforte.\nSie besteht anscheinend aus mehreren\naufeinandergestapelten Wesen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgió de un Ultraumbral. Parece estar\ncompuesto de varias criaturas que se han\ncombinado para formar un solo ser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È arrivato attraverso un Ultravarco. Sembra\nessere costituito da più creature impilate che\nformano una singola unità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each one\nappears to be made up of many life-forms\nstacked one on top of each other.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラホールから　出現した。\n複数の　生命が　積み上がり\n１匹を　形成している　ようだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从究极之洞里出现。\n好像是复数的生命累积起来，\n形成了１只。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgió de un Ultraumbral. Parece estar\ncompuesto de varias criaturas que se han\ncombinado para formar un solo ser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢらしき　なぞの　せいめいたい。\nとつぜん　うごきだして　おそってきた\nいしがきの　しょうたいは　こいつだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "UB 같은 수수께끼의 생명체.\n갑자기 움직이기 시작해서 덮쳐온\n돌담의 정체는 이 녀석이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "疑似究極異獸的神秘生命體。\n突然動起來展開襲擊的石牆，\n它的真面目就是這個傢伙。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On suppose que cette mystérieuse forme de vie\nest une Ultra-Chimère. Si un mur se met en\nbranle et vous attaque sans prévenir, c’est lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese rätselhafte Lebensform ist vermutlich eine\nUltrabestie. Sie sieht aus wie eine Steinmauer,\nbis sie sich plötzlich bewegt und angreift.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Extraña criatura que podría ser un Ultraente.\nParece un muro rocoso hasta que se mueve de\nrepente y ataca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questa misteriosa forma di vita sembra essere\nun’Ultracreatura. Se all’improvviso un muro si\nmuove e attacca, in realtà si tratta di lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When stone walls started moving and attacking,\nthe brute’s true identity was this mysterious\nlife-form, which brings to mind an Ultra Beast.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢらしき　謎の　生命体。\n突然　動き出して　襲ってきた\n石垣の　正体は　こいつだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "像是究极异兽的谜一般的生命体。\n突然动起来并展开袭击的石墙，\n正身就是这家伙。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Extraña criatura que podría ser un Ultraente.\nParece un muro rocoso hasta que se mueve de\nrepente y ataca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
